      "source": "Mashable",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795068588/gta-bot/b773ad7163-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795068588/gta-bot/b773ad7163-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "Rockstar may have left space on the GTA 6 map for more to come. 🗺️\n\nAccording to Mashable, Rockstar has hinted that the game's massive map was built with room for future content. It's a hint, not an official announcement, so there are no details on what could be added or when.\n\nIf it pans out, Leonida could keep evolving well after launch.\n\nWhat would you most like to see added to the map down the line?\n\nSource: Mashable\n\n#GTA6 #GTAVI #Leonida #RockstarGames #GrandTheftAutoVI #GTA #GTAOnline #GamingNews #OpenWorld #VideoGames",
