      "source": "Pure Xbox",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795106364/gta-bot/265580e6df-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795106364/gta-bot/265580e6df-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "The official GTA 6 map is now free to download. 🗺️\n\nAccording to Pure Xbox, the official map can be downloaded at no cost. If you've been waiting to study the world of Leonida, this is one to grab. Check the official source for the download details before you save anything.\n\nWill you be planning your first routes ahead of launch, or saving the exploring for when you can play?\n\nSource: Pure Xbox\n\n#GTA6 #GTAVI #GrandTheftAutoVI #Leonida #RockstarGames #GTA #GTA6Map #GTANews #Gaming #GamingNews",
